WEBVTT

01:33.980 --> 01:38.500
<b>Words for My Friends</b>

01:34.240 --> 01:36.500
"Words for My Friends."

01:40.440 --> 01:41.520
Invited!

01:41.520 --> 01:46.160
I-I h-humbly th-thank you 
for inviting me over for brea—

01:46.370 --> 01:50.430
Now, no need to be so formal.

01:50.430 --> 01:53.910
Bachiko-chan, great job on the training.

01:53.910 --> 01:55.640
Th-Thanks...

01:58.180 --> 02:01.930
Iruma-kun won and 
was promoted to rank Dalet,

02:01.930 --> 02:03.860
so this is the least I can do to thank you.

02:03.860 --> 02:05.590
Oh, no!

02:06.640 --> 02:10.620
I'm devi glad that I asked you 
to do this, Bachiko-chan.

02:10.620 --> 02:14.380
You're on par with 
the Thirteen Crowns, too.

02:14.380 --> 02:15.770
N-Not at all!

02:15.770 --> 02:19.550
The members of the Thirteen Crowns 
are far stronger than I am!

02:19.550 --> 02:24.420
I'm nothing at all in comparison...

02:24.420 --> 02:26.210
What?!

02:29.040 --> 02:32.370
Ya still eatin' that kiddy crap?

02:32.370 --> 02:35.550
Ya even smell sugary sweet!

02:35.550 --> 02:37.620
Yeah, well, you smell so country bumpkin,

02:37.620 --> 02:40.680
mushrooms are gonna grow 
on me if you get too close!

02:40.680 --> 02:43.670
Huh?! Whaddaya say to me?!

02:43.670 --> 02:45.840
You want a piece of me, huh?!

02:47.180 --> 02:49.320
You havin' fun, huh?!

02:49.320 --> 02:51.680
You best believe I am, damn it!

02:51.680 --> 02:54.280
I'm gonna sing until 
I lose my voice, damn it!

02:54.280 --> 02:56.200
I'm puttin' in a song, damn it!

02:56.190 --> 02:58.690
<b>Points</b>

02:56.200 --> 02:58.690
Got a perfect score, damn it!

02:58.690 --> 03:00.160
Barrier, damn it!

03:00.160 --> 03:01.910
Gonna nullify your barrier, damn it!

03:01.910 --> 03:04.160
Well, I'm nullifying your 
nullification, damn it!

03:04.160 --> 03:07.080
Well, I'm gonna nullify you nullifying 
my nullification, damn it!

03:09.880 --> 03:14.030
Other than that really annoying woman 
and her lame clothes!

03:15.210 --> 03:16.540
Aw, you're so close.

03:16.540 --> 03:18.120
Not at all!

03:19.610 --> 03:20.880
Well...

03:21.160 --> 03:23.360
You have a hard time being around others,

03:23.360 --> 03:27.430
so I was worried you wouldn't
 accept tutoring Iruma-kun.

03:28.840 --> 03:30.440
Right.

03:30.440 --> 03:33.920
At first, I thought I'd just get a look at his face and then leave.

03:33.920 --> 03:36.360
Looks like you need to work 
on that fighting spirit!

03:36.360 --> 03:38.030
Well?!

03:38.410 --> 03:39.320
But...

03:42.570 --> 03:43.540
But...

03:47.850 --> 03:52.820
Now, I proudly consider 
him my number one student!

03:54.990 --> 03:56.460
I see.

03:56.460 --> 03:58.440
Well, eat to your heart's content.

03:58.440 --> 03:59.560
Yes, sir!

04:00.720 --> 04:03.520
<i>Sullivan-sama is pleased.</i>

04:03.520 --> 04:06.310
<i>He's complimenting me!</i>

04:06.310 --> 04:07.470
<i>I...</i>

04:08.520 --> 04:10.180
<i>I...</i>

04:10.180 --> 04:11.740
<i>Really...</i>

04:44.090 --> 04:45.470
Now, then...

04:45.830 --> 04:47.950
Are you full?

04:47.950 --> 04:50.280
Yes! Thank you very much for the meal!

04:50.280 --> 04:51.970
I'm glad you liked it.

04:52.360 --> 04:55.480
Well, we'll get this all out of the way...

05:00.000 --> 05:03.110
and let's discuss our next topic.

05:05.900 --> 05:08.620
<b>Perfect Speak</b>

05:05.900 --> 05:08.620
<b>Eavesdropping Protection</b>

05:06.340 --> 05:07.950
Perfect Speak!

05:09.400 --> 05:12.870
I, Barbatos Bachiko, humbly accept.

05:12.870 --> 05:14.000
Mm.

05:14.870 --> 05:18.830
First, the next Thirteens' Dinner 
has been canceled.

05:18.830 --> 05:19.680
Huh?

05:19.680 --> 05:22.440
Because of the growing 
number of capable demons

05:22.440 --> 05:24.880
who have gone missing in the past few days.

05:27.290 --> 05:31.290
Devilam. The battlefield.

05:27.300 --> 05:29.390
<b><i>Devilam</i></b>

05:27.300 --> 05:29.390
<b><i>Nobles Gathering</i></b>

05:29.800 --> 05:32.140
<b><i>Battlefield</i></b>

05:31.930 --> 05:36.010
High-ranked demons 
are disappearing everywhere.

05:36.240 --> 05:38.050
The motive is unknown,

05:38.050 --> 05:40.770
but we know who's responsible.

05:41.180 --> 05:42.140
You do?

05:42.580 --> 05:43.640
Yes.

05:45.330 --> 05:49.400
They've been suspects
 in the most evil deeds...

05:51.100 --> 05:52.840
The Musashino Crew.

05:52.530 --> 05:54.910
<b>The 
Musashino
 Crew</b>

05:54.910 --> 05:59.790
Because they haven't left any 
signs behind, we know it's them.

06:02.060 --> 06:03.360
I see.

06:04.010 --> 06:05.420
Which means...

06:07.000 --> 06:10.510
It's time for the thing I'm proudest of.

06:10.510 --> 06:13.430
My ultimate bow.

06:13.430 --> 06:15.920
That's what this means, right?

06:16.380 --> 06:18.180
Oh, sorry! No, no.

06:18.180 --> 06:19.060
Huh?

06:19.060 --> 06:21.260
I-It's not?

06:21.260 --> 06:24.050
No, it's not. You can put that down.

06:25.760 --> 06:29.120
When things are uneasy in the netherworld,

06:29.120 --> 06:32.360
instructors should 
concentrate on education.

06:32.830 --> 06:35.520
We provide the students 
with the best knowledge,

06:35.520 --> 06:37.690
nurture them, and protect them.

06:38.040 --> 06:44.470
We adults need to make sure we guide them 
so we can ensure peace in the netherworld.

06:48.480 --> 06:49.590
Right?

06:49.590 --> 06:51.080
Yes, sir!

06:52.530 --> 06:53.960
<i>This...</i>

06:53.960 --> 06:55.870
<i>This is Lord Sullivan, 
one of the Three Greats</i>

06:55.870 --> 06:57.410
<i>and next in line to become the Demon King!</i>

06:57.410 --> 06:59.790
<i>His words are far greater than others'!</i>

06:59.790 --> 07:01.040
So, Bachiko-chan...

07:01.040 --> 07:02.480
Uh, yes!

07:02.850 --> 07:06.560
Please continue to be my 
grandson's special tutor.

07:06.560 --> 07:07.250
Yes, sir!

07:07.250 --> 07:09.080
Especially since Iruma-kun's human.

07:09.080 --> 07:09.980
Right!

07:12.000 --> 07:12.810
Huh?

07:14.720 --> 07:15.480
Hm?

07:19.740 --> 07:22.250
What?!

07:22.250 --> 07:24.790
A human?!

07:27.260 --> 07:29.290
A human?!

07:29.670 --> 07:38.560
Tweet, tweet, tweet...

07:31.170 --> 07:34.820
The only ones who know of this truth 
are myself, the chairdemon,

07:34.820 --> 07:37.420
and Instructor Balam.

07:37.420 --> 07:38.560
Bachiko-chan.

07:40.160 --> 07:42.660
I will respect your wishes.

07:43.140 --> 07:45.820
Would you like me to erase \your memory of this conversation,

07:46.320 --> 07:49.460
or will you protect Iruma-kun with us?

07:55.680 --> 07:57.080
I—

07:57.080 --> 07:59.010
Good morning.

07:59.010 --> 08:01.200
Opera-san, what's for breakfast toda—

08:01.200 --> 08:03.370
Wait... Master?! Why, though?!

08:03.370 --> 08:05.960
Iruma-kun! Good morning!

08:05.960 --> 08:07.240
G-Good, uh...

08:07.240 --> 08:09.470
We're serving omelets for breakfast today.

08:09.470 --> 08:13.080
Uh, yay! Uh, but, Master... why? Huh?

08:09.780 --> 08:11.400
<i>A human...</i>

08:13.080 --> 08:17.090
<i>Suddenly, everything makes perfect sense.</i>

08:22.820 --> 08:23.960
<i>I mean...</i>

08:24.680 --> 08:28.270
<i>I mean, if he's not a demon...</i>

08:29.030 --> 08:30.430
<i>That just means...</i>

08:30.430 --> 08:36.410
<i>he's the only student for me!</i>

08:37.500 --> 08:38.470
<i>For crying out loud...</i>

08:38.470 --> 08:42.720
<i>I don't care if you're human or whatever.</i>

08:42.720 --> 08:45.960
<i>I'll continue...</i>

08:46.410 --> 08:48.790
<i>lookin' after ya!</i>

08:54.300 --> 08:55.600
Bachiko-chan?

08:55.600 --> 08:58.040
You've been using Iruma-kun 
as your errand boy?

08:58.040 --> 08:58.560
No!

08:58.560 --> 08:59.940
I don't think I can let that go.

08:59.940 --> 09:01.140
Er, no! You've got the wrong idea!

09:01.150 --> 09:02.720
This is just part of his training, and—

09:02.990 --> 09:04.600
I even clean and do her laundry!

09:05.600 --> 09:09.610
You stupid student of mine!

09:10.970 --> 09:12.600
I'm so full!

09:12.600 --> 09:16.710
I don't know exactly what's going on, 
but Master yelled at me again.

09:16.710 --> 09:18.400
I was just doing what I usually do...

09:20.620 --> 09:22.160
Ali-san?

09:22.160 --> 09:24.120
Hm, I wonder if he's asleep.

09:24.590 --> 09:27.450
I need to see how much 
mana we have left later.

09:27.450 --> 09:29.370
Iruma-chi!

09:33.190 --> 09:35.060
Heya!

09:36.430 --> 09:38.260
<b>Invitation</b>

09:38.890 --> 09:40.760
Okay, I'm going.

09:42.020 --> 09:44.240
Iruma-kun, come back soon, okay?

09:44.240 --> 09:46.580
He'll be back tonight.

09:53.160 --> 09:55.040
Isn't going to Azz-kun's place exciting?

09:53.600 --> 09:55.820
<i>He's human, huh...</i>

09:55.040 --> 09:56.610
I wonder if he has Pekepon.

09:57.200 --> 09:59.480
Good morning, David-san!

09:59.480 --> 10:01.360
Good morning.

10:01.360 --> 10:03.400
Now, let us get going...

10:04.640 --> 10:06.720
to the Asmodeus household.

10:08.710 --> 10:12.250
<b>Sure</b>

10:12.960 --> 10:16.510
<b>You slay me!</b>

10:17.220 --> 10:21.140
<b>Let's 
play!</b>

10:30.760 --> 10:32.680
We have arrived.

10:34.810 --> 10:37.400
Grandpa's house is big, but...

10:37.770 --> 10:40.350
Azz-kun's home is amazing, too!

10:41.910 --> 10:45.400
Devi! Devier! Deviest! And it's huge!

10:47.960 --> 10:50.790
Welcome! I have been waiting for you!

10:50.790 --> 10:52.300
Th-Thanks for inviting us over.

10:52.300 --> 10:53.700
Yes, please, come in!

10:53.700 --> 10:55.800
We have prepared everything for you!

10:55.800 --> 10:59.300
I'm so excited. I brought you a gift.

10:58.170 --> 10:59.300
Ooh.

10:59.300 --> 11:01.300
A gift from Iruma-sama!

11:01.300 --> 11:02.800
I have one for you, too, Clara.

11:04.050 --> 11:06.060
Captain 
of the 
Charge

11:06.060 --> 11:08.060
Captain 
of the
 Charge

11:08.050 --> 11:09.800
C-Clara?

11:09.800 --> 11:13.130
Conner and Murf! Ready, and...

11:13.570 --> 11:15.940
Charge!

11:16.410 --> 11:18.530
Clara!

11:19.430 --> 11:20.400
Hiyah!

11:20.400 --> 11:21.910
Ooh!

11:22.240 --> 11:24.040
A super frilly room!

11:27.280 --> 11:29.920
A super sparkly room!

11:32.780 --> 11:35.550
The base has been 
conquered in the courtyard!

11:33.040 --> 11:37.880
<b>The sign has been conquered! In the courtyard.</b>

11:40.100 --> 11:43.920
Summit reached! Where there is a pot, 
it shall be climbed!

11:43.920 --> 11:46.440
Don't go climbing on any pots!

11:46.440 --> 11:48.180
Climb up here with me, Iruma-chi!

11:48.180 --> 11:51.370
That's dangerous! Azz-kun's 
going to yell at you, too.

11:51.370 --> 11:52.760
Nay, Iruma-sama.

11:52.760 --> 11:55.400
This isn't enough for me to get angry.

11:55.400 --> 11:56.160
Huh?

11:56.660 --> 11:58.200
And that's because...

11:58.200 --> 12:00.980
Iruma-sama and I are both...

12:00.980 --> 12:04.030
Rank Dalet, after all.

12:09.800 --> 12:11.920
Cause some commotion if you must!

12:11.920 --> 12:15.780
Whatever a mere rank Gimel like 
yourself does cannot faze me!

12:15.780 --> 12:20.960
Because Iruma-sama 
and I are both rank Dalet!

12:26.100 --> 12:29.310
You are a mere Gimel. I am a Dalet!

12:29.310 --> 12:31.600
The one on the same level as Iruma-sama...

12:31.890 --> 12:34.050
is me!

12:34.490 --> 12:36.980
Bwah!

12:37.340 --> 12:40.610
Hmph. Now you can have a taste of my pain!

12:41.570 --> 12:43.760
Harumphhhhh.

12:42.710 --> 12:43.760
Clara,

12:43.760 --> 12:45.360
it's fine that you're rank Gimel...

12:45.360 --> 12:47.320
Iruma-chi, let me see your badge!

12:46.640 --> 12:47.320
Huh?!

12:47.320 --> 12:49.700
I'm gonna write "Gimel" on it! Right now!

12:48.700 --> 12:51.080
<b>Right now!!</b>

12:49.700 --> 12:51.080
Stop that!

12:51.080 --> 12:53.260
Let's leave that fool behind 
and have some tea.

12:53.260 --> 12:56.340
But I'm close with him, too! Because I...

12:56.340 --> 12:59.840
got to do devi lots with small Iruma-chi!

13:00.610 --> 13:02.470
A small Iruma-sama?!

13:02.380 --> 13:03.840
<i>Yay</i>

13:02.470 --> 13:03.840
<i>Yay!</i>

13:03.840 --> 13:06.240
Hang on! What kind of Iruma-sama is that?!

13:06.240 --> 13:07.090
Heh!

13:07.090 --> 13:07.950
Step!

13:07.950 --> 13:10.850
I'm not gonna tell you, Azz-Azz!

13:10.850 --> 13:12.350
Why, you little...!

13:21.240 --> 13:22.170
Tell me!

13:22.170 --> 13:23.090
Nuh-uh!

13:23.090 --> 13:24.440
C-Come on, you two...

13:24.440 --> 13:27.550
Everyone, the tea is ready.

13:30.200 --> 13:33.150
These are cakes I ordered 
specially for our party!

13:33.150 --> 13:35.250
Please, help yourselves!

13:35.250 --> 13:37.080
L-Let's eat!

13:39.590 --> 13:41.370
So good!

13:41.370 --> 13:44.580
Please eat as much as you'd like.

13:44.580 --> 13:46.340
I can eat all of it!

13:46.340 --> 13:48.630
Well met, Iruma-sama!

13:46.850 --> 13:50.160
Yay! They all look yummy!

13:51.640 --> 13:53.090
Ahem.

13:53.090 --> 13:55.290
This is my room.

13:55.290 --> 13:57.530
Oh, this is your room, Azz-kun?

13:57.530 --> 13:58.600
Ooh!

13:59.020 --> 14:00.920
Azz-kun's room...

14:00.920 --> 14:02.990
I wonder what it's like.

14:09.000 --> 14:11.130
A-Azz-kun? What is all this?

14:11.130 --> 14:12.400
Lotsa Iruma-chis!

14:12.400 --> 14:14.700
Why, yes! Various 
commemorative school papers

14:14.700 --> 14:17.740
and my treasured scrapbook with 
your various amazing deeds recorded!

14:17.740 --> 14:19.920
A-Azz-kun!

14:20.840 --> 14:23.820
Go! Gorgon Snake!

14:25.750 --> 14:27.080
You think this is okay?

14:27.080 --> 14:28.720
Well, they're very well-behaved.

14:28.720 --> 14:30.510
Hey, hey, Iruma-chi!

14:30.840 --> 14:34.350
You should summon Eggy-sensei, Iruma-chi.

14:37.720 --> 14:39.170
Huh?!

14:39.170 --> 14:41.860
Yeah... maybe not today.

14:43.320 --> 14:46.200
Are you all right, Kalego-sensei?

14:46.200 --> 14:49.270
I'm fine. I just got a slight chill...

14:49.070 --> 14:50.950
<b>Working-On-Their-Day-Off Crew</b>

14:51.750 --> 14:54.700
Valac! Stop climbing on top of me!

14:54.700 --> 14:57.970
Heh, the piggy-back technique I 
learned from the Game Battler!

14:57.970 --> 14:59.540
Aw, I lost again.

14:59.540 --> 15:01.820
Azz-Azz, you're protecting 
Iruma-chi too much.

15:01.820 --> 15:03.950
Iruma-chi hasn't moved a step.

15:04.720 --> 15:06.710
Oh, I'm gonna go to the bathroom.

15:06.710 --> 15:08.350
Oh, right. Very well?!

15:07.460 --> 15:08.350
<i>K.O.!</i>

15:16.820 --> 15:18.660
I'm having so much fun!

15:18.660 --> 15:22.520
I'm playing so much with Azz-kun 
and Clara, talking a bunch...

15:22.980 --> 15:26.480
Those two... are my friends...

15:31.450 --> 15:32.600
But...

15:35.640 --> 15:40.720
There's... still something 
that I haven't told them.

15:45.920 --> 15:48.810
<i>I decided that I'm going to 
live in the netherworld</i>

15:48.810 --> 15:51.080
<i>and they're my precious friends.</i>

15:51.490 --> 15:52.560
<i>So...</i>

15:54.720 --> 15:56.070
<i>I have to tell them.</i>

15:57.520 --> 15:58.430
<i>But...</i>

15:59.210 --> 16:01.530
<i>If they end up rejecting me...</i>

16:02.680 --> 16:05.850
<i>Or... even worse...</i>

16:08.200 --> 16:11.320
<i>If they give in to their 
demonic instincts, and...</i>

16:13.530 --> 16:15.680
Chomp!

16:15.680 --> 16:18.530
Who's the little imp behind you?

16:19.920 --> 16:20.650
Amu—

16:20.650 --> 16:22.460
Why, yes! It's Amu-chan!

16:22.460 --> 16:23.920
I'm Alice-chan's mama!

16:23.920 --> 16:27.640
Oh, Alice-chan is just so mean! Hear me out!

16:27.640 --> 16:29.920
He left me out again!

16:28.880 --> 16:29.920
Huh?!

16:30.560 --> 16:34.680
I just got the feeling that Alice-chan 
had called you two over to the house,

16:34.680 --> 16:37.760
so I flew the coop at work 
and zoomed right over!

16:36.520 --> 16:38.220
I'll be right there!

16:38.220 --> 16:39.680
Amu-sama?!

16:41.260 --> 16:42.510
Is she an esper?!

16:41.430 --> 16:44.310
<b>A woman's
 intuition...!!</b>

16:41.430 --> 16:44.310
<b>A woman's
 intuition...!!</b>

16:41.430 --> 16:44.310
<b>Esper</b>

16:41.430 --> 16:44.310
<b>Esper</b>

16:42.510 --> 16:44.310
A woman's intuition!

16:44.790 --> 16:45.940
So...

16:45.940 --> 16:49.810
What exactly did you have to say?

16:53.790 --> 16:55.690
Hm...

16:55.690 --> 17:00.600
So you're keeping a secret 
from those two... huh.

17:02.180 --> 17:03.810
I think it's fine...

17:03.810 --> 17:05.080
if you don't tell them.

17:05.080 --> 17:06.150
Huh?

17:07.050 --> 17:09.840
But they're my really important friends—

17:09.840 --> 17:11.350
Oh, my.

17:11.350 --> 17:18.170
Are these... "friends" someone 
you have to tell everything?

17:22.230 --> 17:23.730
Love...

17:24.170 --> 17:28.400
doesn't work out 
unless all parties are happy.

17:32.330 --> 17:35.760
You sounded so pained 
when you said you had to tell them.

17:35.760 --> 17:38.440
You're not obligated to do that.

17:38.440 --> 17:44.450
We demons must be much 
 freer and sexier.

17:47.450 --> 17:55.460
Or can you really not be "friends" 
if you have a secret?

18:04.110 --> 18:05.450
<i>You lose!</i>

18:05.450 --> 18:07.560
Heh. I win again!

18:07.560 --> 18:08.600
Why, you little—

18:08.600 --> 18:10.480
Oh! Welcome back, Iruma-sa—

18:13.120 --> 18:16.870
Mother! What are you doing here?! 
More importantly...

18:21.610 --> 18:23.590
Iruma-sama! Why are you dressed like that?!

18:23.590 --> 18:25.760
Lookie look! Isn't he adorable?

18:25.760 --> 18:28.490
I put him in a bunch 
of your old clothes, Alice-chan!

18:28.490 --> 18:31.160
One sec! I'll go get 
some other outfits, too!

18:31.630 --> 18:35.630
Er, wait! Mothe— Why is she so fast?!

18:32.380 --> 18:33.320
Can I put on the ribbon?

18:33.320 --> 18:34.720
Sure.

18:34.720 --> 18:35.630
Yay!

18:35.630 --> 18:38.000
I'm so sorry, Iruma-sama! I'll go stop her!

18:36.290 --> 18:37.470
Ribbon!

18:38.000 --> 18:40.890
Oh, just a sec, you two... Have a seat.

18:43.110 --> 18:45.680
I have something to tell you.

19:04.400 --> 19:06.260
First, Azz-kun.

19:06.260 --> 19:07.910
Yes!

19:08.210 --> 19:12.790
At the end of the Harvest Festival... 
When you came to us...

19:20.860 --> 19:22.680
I was so relieved.

19:24.920 --> 19:26.930
You were so cool.

19:27.600 --> 19:31.440
Thank you so much for protecting us!

19:34.680 --> 19:37.230
Y-You bless me with your words!

19:37.780 --> 19:39.290
And, Clara...

19:39.290 --> 19:40.320
Yes?

19:41.360 --> 19:43.570
The reason I was able to make 
the Legend Leaf bloom...

19:46.220 --> 19:47.870
is because of you, Clara.

19:50.020 --> 19:53.610
You went through something scary,

19:53.610 --> 19:57.880
but you helped me out and believed in me...

19:58.260 --> 20:00.000
Thank you so much!

20:04.010 --> 20:09.960
You two are so important to me 
and I always want to be with you...

20:10.940 --> 20:12.510
So...

20:14.960 --> 20:16.370
So I...

20:19.230 --> 20:23.000
I... I'm so happy...

20:23.910 --> 20:26.120
that you're both my friends.

20:35.710 --> 20:38.280
Iruma-sama!

20:35.710 --> 20:38.280
Iruma-chi!

20:37.280 --> 20:38.280
Whoa!

20:38.280 --> 20:39.900
<i>This is what...</i>

20:39.900 --> 20:43.600
<i>I want to tell you two right now 
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

20:45.820 --> 20:48.950
<i>One day, I want to tell you everything...</i>

20:48.950 --> 20:50.910
<i>as the three of us laugh.</i>

20:52.520 --> 20:55.120
Amu-chan's back!

20:53.180 --> 20:57.270
<b>To Clara {right}</b>

20:53.430 --> 20:57.270
<b>To Azz-kun</b>

20:57.680 --> 20:59.440
<i>And...</i>

20:59.440 --> 21:01.900
<i>After I tell you the truth...</i>

21:02.460 --> 21:07.280
<i>if we can remain unchanged 
and continue walking together forever...</i>

22:54.060 --> 22:56.060
<b>Current Ranking!!</b>

22:54.400 --> 22:59.010
<i>After the Harvest Festival, Iruma 
and Lead were successfully promoted to Dalet.</i>

22:57.450 --> 23:05.780
<b>Dalet</b>

22:57.450 --> 23:07.320
<b>Gimel</b>

22:59.330 --> 23:03.410
<i>But, unless the rest of their 
classmates all reach rank Dalet,</i>

23:03.410 --> 23:05.960
<i>they'll all be kicked out of the Royal One.</i>

23:06.340 --> 23:07.320
<i>Iruma and the others</i>

23:06.570 --> 23:07.320
<b>Bet</b>

23:07.320 --> 23:13.070
<b>Music Festival</b>

23:08.050 --> 23:10.950
<i>are about to take on the final 
rank-advancement exam for first-years...</i>

23:10.950 --> 23:13.060
<i>The Music Festival!</i>

23:13.430 --> 23:15.080
Alrighty!

23:15.080 --> 23:18.080
We're gonna concentrate most 
on how to get Nee-san up two ranks,

23:18.440 --> 23:22.820
and make sure the guys at Gimel also get 
to shine in whatever performance we do.

23:28.840 --> 23:30.830
What's the matter, Iruma-sama?

23:30.830 --> 23:31.700
Er...

23:31.700 --> 23:35.100
I think we're forgetting 
something really important.

23:36.220 --> 23:39.720
Hey, what are you going to 
do about the other one?

23:41.730 --> 23:43.200
Th-The other one?

23:43.200 --> 23:46.300
There's clearly one more in rank Bet.

23:46.300 --> 23:47.990
Huh? But who? And where?!

23:47.990 --> 23:50.480
Again. Right there.

23:52.660 --> 23:56.620
<i>Perhaps some of our wise viewers remember...</i>

23:56.620 --> 23:59.630
<i>Purson Soi. Rank Bet.</i>

23:59.630 --> 24:02.820
<i>He is another member of the Misfit Class.</i>

24:02.820 --> 24:03.920
Purson Soi.

24:05.560 --> 24:06.710
Huh?

24:07.960 --> 24:09.970
What?!

24:10.230 --> 24:12.640
<i>What has he been doing this whole time?</i>

24:12.640 --> 24:15.470
<i>Why hasn't he shown himself?</i>

24:16.590 --> 24:21.480
<i>What kind of drama awaits us 
at the Music Festival?</i>

24:21.850 --> 24:26.790
<i>We will tell you that story another time.</i>
